    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f8bc4578c39c107a",
      "translationZh": "改进的 Gemini 音频模型，带来强大的语音交互",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ec9864917de0ea1",
      "translationZh": "产品管理总监",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8344d80b890aaaf",
      "translationZh": "杰出研究科学家",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfda743acf479c5b",
      "translationZh": "Google 增强了 Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio，以打造更出色的实时语音智能体。您可以期待更精准的函数调用、更可靠的指令遵循和更流畅的对话。欢迎试用 Google Translate 应用测试版中的实时语音翻译功能，该功能现正向美国、墨西哥和印度的 Android 用户逐步推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ddd8ac3eb59c187",
      "translationZh": "“改进的 Gemini 音频模型，带来强大的语音交互”提升了实时智能体和翻译的能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7181b7ce69f96db",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio 现在具备更精准的函数调用能力和更强的指令遵循能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "65445ca0e1799c96",
      "translationZh": "此次更新可从此前的对话轮次中检索上下文，让对话更加流畅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ffe4b5d4021d9bd",
      "translationZh": "Google Translate 中的实时语音翻译可保留语调，并支持 70+ 种语言。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b3b41fc01925c7fc",
      "translationZh": "你今天就可以在 Vertex AI 上使用 Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio 开始构建语音智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42b79d29f6cb7acd",
      "translationZh": "Google 提升了其 Gemini AI 在对话中的理解和表达能力。它现在能更好地理解指令，进行更流畅的对话，并实时翻译语言。这意味着 AI 可以帮助企业提供客户服务，也能让人们更好地相互理解，即使他们说着不同的语言。你甚至可以在 Google Translate 应用中试用实时翻译功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e14a2b0ee4204faa",
      "translationZh": "本周早些时候，我们升级了 Gemini 2.5 Pro 和 Flash Text-to-Speech 模型，让用户能够更好地控制音频生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e8c7c64fe926ce0",
      "translationZh": "但生成富有表现力的语音只是对话的一面。今天，我们发布了面向实时语音智能体的新版 Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio。此次更新提升了模型处理复杂工作流、理解并遵循用户指令以及进行自然对话的能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e26978b3de437a63",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio 现已在 Google AI Studio、Vertex AI 等 Google 产品中推出，并已开始在 Gemini Live 和 Search Live 中逐步上线，首次为 Search Live 带来原生音频的自然体验。这意味着，你可以更高效地与 Gemini 实时开展头脑风暴，在 Search Live 中获得实时帮助，或构建新一代可满足企业需求的客户服务智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d26d64573ceacbd5",
      "translationZh": "除了为实用的智能体提供支持，原生音频还为全球交流开辟了新的可能性。我们正在推出实时语音翻译功能，让用户通过耳机体验流式语音到语音翻译。它能保留说话者的语调、语速节奏和音高。这项测试版体验从今天起开始在 Google Translate 应用中逐步推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7567d97168ca379d",
      "translationZh": "为支持不同界面和产品中的广泛用例，我们在三个关键方面改进了 Gemini 2.5 Native Audio：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7c60fd6d4d953d4",
      "translationZh": "更精准的函数调用：我们提升了模型在触发外部函数时的可靠性。现在，它能更准确地判断对话中何时需要获取实时信息，并将这些数据无缝融入音频回复，而不中断对话流程。在涵盖多种约束条件下的多步函数调用的评测 ComplexFuncBench Audio 中，Gemini 2.5 Native Audio 以 71.5% 的得分领先。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "62d9ccce6e5cb52d",
      "translationZh": "更可靠的指令遵循：模型现在更善于处理复杂指令，从而提高了用户对内容完整性的满意度。它对开发者指令的遵循率达到 90%（此前为 84%），能够提供更可靠的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "91f702cba0ba81d2",
      "translationZh": "更流畅的对话：我们在多轮对话质量方面取得了显著进展。Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio 能够更有效地提取前几轮对话中的上下文，使对话更加连贯。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3efeaf6afe0cce61",
      "translationZh": "更新后的 Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio 与先前版本及行业竞品在 ComplexFuncBench 上的性能对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0fa1da0a71d677da",
      "translationZh": "客户怎么说",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0c20dabc7467cc0",
      "translationZh": "Google Cloud 客户已经在利用 Gemini 的原生音频能力，在抵押贷款处理、客户通话等场景中取得切实的业务成效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7e2617ba5558099b",
      "translationZh": "“用户在使用 Sidekick 后，往往不到一分钟就会忘记自己是在与 AI 交谈，有时甚至会在长时间聊天后向机器人道谢……通过 Gemini [2.5 Flash Native Audio] 提供的全新 Live API AI 能力，助力我们的商家赢得成功。”——David Wurtz，Shopify 产品副总裁",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4c11213619f489b5",
      "translationZh": "“通过集成 Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio 模型……自 2025 年 5 月上线以来，我们显著增强了 Mia 的能力。这一强大组合已帮助我们为经纪合作伙伴促成超过 14,000 笔贷款。”——Jason Bressler，United Wholesale Mortgage (UWM) 首席技术官",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97b33fc14cf28dd2",
      "translationZh": "“通过 Vertex AI 使用 Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio 模型，让 Newo.ai AI 接待员能够实现无与伦比的对话智能……它们即使在嘈杂环境中也能识别主要说话者，在对话中途切换语言，而且声音极其自然，富有情感表现力。”——David Yang，Newo.ai 联合创始人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0085febec961d28f",
      "translationZh": "实时语音翻译",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b579d70faa54d04",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 现已原生支持全新的实时语音到语音翻译能力，可同时应对持续聆听和双向对话场景。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "920eec9cf89f2886",
      "translationZh": "在持续聆听模式下，Gemini 会自动将多种语言的语音翻译为同一种目标语言。这样，你只需戴上耳机，就能用自己的语言聆听周围的世界。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10e7d2fee25b9025",
      "translationZh": "在双向对话中，Gemini 的实时语音翻译能够实时处理两种语言之间的翻译，并根据说话者自动切换输出语言。例如，如果你说英语，想与一位说印地语的人聊天，你会在耳机中实时听到英语译文，而当你说完话后，手机则会播放印地语译文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b609f56512d5b67",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 的实时语音翻译具备多项在现实场景中实用的关键能力：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "642b228f6e3a72c2",
      "translationZh": "语言覆盖：将 Gemini 模型的世界知识、多语言能力与其原生音频能力相结合，支持超过 70 种语言、2000 个语言对的语音翻译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1573476d9117bf15",
      "translationZh": "风格迁移：捕捉人类语音的细微差别，保留说话者的语调、语速节奏和音高，让翻译听起来自然。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f0ebc4a18c7f0e6d",
      "translationZh": "多语言输入：在同一次会话中同时理解多种语言，帮助你跟上多语言对话，无需反复调整语言设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c94c0c9026a0d3ae",
      "translationZh": "自动检测：识别所说的语言并开始翻译，因此即使你不知道对方说的是哪种语言，也能开始翻译。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f4fd98401d6fcab4",
      "translationZh": "噪声鲁棒性：滤除环境噪声，让你即使身处嘈杂的户外环境，也能轻松交谈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d2faecb00c7f8bd",
      "translationZh": "从今天起，你可以在 Google Translate 应用中试用全新的测试版体验：将耳机连接到设备，然后点按“Live translate”，即可通过耳机收听实时翻译。这项体验正向美国、墨西哥和印度的所有 Android 设备逐步推出，对 iOS 和更多地区的支持也即将到来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca6fdeea3ccb5aaf",
      "translationZh": "我们将根据反馈持续迭代这项体验，并于 2026 年将其引入更多 Google 产品，包括 Gemini API。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4eaa24970fa21d8d",
      "translationZh": "即日起，使用 Gemini 2.5 Flash Native Audio 开始构建语音智能体。该模型现已在 Vertex AI 上正式发布，并在 Gemini API 中提供预览版。前往 Google AI Studio 试用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8eb5f205a904919",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 2.5 Flash 和 2.5 Pro 文本转语音模型也可在 Google AI Studio 中通过 Gemini API 使用。阅读语音生成文档、探索提示编写指南，或查阅 Gemini API Cookbook，即可开始使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81c0514443d15d43",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon：开启我们的前沿智能新时代",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1dcfa6e64bf1becb",
      "translationZh": "看看 4 位开发者正在用 Gemini 3.8 Flash 构建什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "39afd3b78512f5a1",
      "translationZh": "隆重推出搭载 Live Avatar 的 Gemini 3.8 Live",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c6c3ba8ca3a0a1e",
      "translationZh": "作者：Shuo-yiin Chang 和 CJ Zheng",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "70d482221fed8fb8",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 文本转语音前来问好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
